SUMMARY:Deadline: 100 Screams: Open Call for Screamers (worldwide\, partici
 patory)
DESCRIPTION:Vietnamese multimedia artist and poet Nguyen Hoang Gia Bao (tex
 t\, sound\, moving image\, performance) is collecting 100 scream recording
 s and 100 inscriptions from participants anywhere in the world for 100 Scr
 eams.\n\nOrganisation: Nguyen Hoang Gia Bao (independent artist)\nLocation
 : Worldwide\, online submission\; optional offline recording event in Ho C
 hi Minh City\, Vietnam.\nAward: No cash award\; a participatory open call.
  Contributions become part of a 100-hour sound work and spatial installati
 on.\nDuration: One scream recording and one inscription per participant\; 
 no equipment requirements.\n\nMore: https://forms.gle/FCnAgoBed7ZFAHiB7?ut
 m_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
URL:https://forms.gle/FCnAgoBed7ZFAHiB7?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantde
 sk&utm_medium=referral
LOCATION:Worldwide\, online submission\; optional offline recording event i
 n Ho Chi Minh City\, Vietnam.
END:VEVENT
