DTEND:20261220T225900Z
SUMMARY:Deadline 23:59 CET: France Culture x LaScam: Mon premier doc de cre
 ation sonore 2026 (two EUR 5\,000 writing grants for a first audio documen
 tary)
DESCRIPTION:Closes 20 Dec 2026 at 23:59 CET.\n\nFrance Culture and LaScam o
 ffer two EUR 5\,000 grants (Brouillon d'un reve) to write a first creative
  audio documentary in the spirit of L'Experience\, France Culture's strand
  of auteur sound documentaries. The target format is a 57'30 documentary f
 or broadcast or a native podcast series with variable episode length.\n\nO
 rganisation: France Culture (Radio France) and LaScam (Societe civile des 
 auteurs multimedia)\nLocation: France (remote). Projects must be in French
 \; no residence or nationality condition stated.\nAward: Two writing grant
 s of EUR 5\,000 each. No application fee mentioned.\nDuration: Writing gra
 nt\; target work is a 57'30 documentary for L'Experience on France Culture
  or a native podcast series.\n\nMore: https://www.lascam.fr/lessentiel/bou
 rses-brouillon-dun-reve/bourses-pour-la-creation-de-documentaires-audio-fr
 ance-culture-x-la-scam/?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=r
 eferral
URL:https://www.lascam.fr/lessentiel/bourses-brouillon-dun-reve/bourses-pou
 r-la-creation-de-documentaires-audio-france-culture-x-la-scam/?utm_source=
 artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
LOCATION:France (remote). Projects must be in French\; no residence or nati
 onality condition stated.
END:VEVENT
