SUMMARY:Deadline 14:00 CET: Berlin Senate Work and Research Stipends 2027: 
 Early Music\, New Music and Sound Art (Klangkunst)
DESCRIPTION:Closes 12 Jan 2027 at 14:00 CET.\n\nThe Berlin Senate's annual 
 stipends for professional musicians and sound artists living in Berlin\, h
 ere in the early music\, new music and sound art (Klangkunst) strand: a EU
 R 12\,000 work stipend or a EUR 8\,000 research stipend. Applicants must h
 ave their main residence in Berlin and must not be enrolled students. Dead
 line 12 January 2027\, 14:00 Berlin time. No application fee.\n\nOrganisat
 ion: Senate Department for Culture and Social Cohesion\, Berlin\nLocation:
  Berlin\, Germany. Main residence in Berlin required.\nAward: EUR 12\,000 
 work stipend or EUR 8\,000 research stipend (number of awards not stated).
 \nDuration: Stipend for a work or research period in 2027.\n\nMore: https:
 //www.berlin.de/sen/kultur/foerderung/foerderprogramme/musik/artikel.82427
 .php?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
URL:https://www.berlin.de/sen/kultur/foerderung/foerderprogramme/musik/arti
 kel.82427.php?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
LOCATION:Berlin\, Germany. Main residence in Berlin required.
